No.

Slotless anything is useful, but what else were you going to use your 
ring slots for besides conflict, anyway?  Compare to getting "very fast" 
slotless (from spell), which frees up your feet for jumping boots.

As an early conflict source, the Scepter is a lot worse than a ring, 
because you want to be able to turn it on and off frequently.

Slotless MR is very good, also very common in Quest artifacts.

As a weapon: Even if we pretend the double damage works 100% of the time, 
which it does not, you can't take real advantage of it until you have 
enchanted it up and/or gained STR.  By that time weapons won't be 
important any more.


The Eye abilities are better, and unique.








